OL,3,GNEWSANine-day rail closure begins for
OL,4,Atrack upgrades
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-day closure of a stretch of rail
OL,7,Ftrack for improvements has begun,
OL,8,Fimpacting journeys in parts of west
OL,9,FKent and East Sussex.
OL,11,FThe line between Tonbridge and Wadhurst
OL,12,Fis closed until 1 November, with the
OL,13,Fclosure extending to Battle on the
OL,14,Ffinal day.
OL,16,FBuses will replace trains where they
OL,17,Fcan't run, but services from Tonbridge
OL,18,Fto London, Ashford and Redhill will be
OL,19,Funaffected by the closure. A shuttle
OL,20,Ftrain service will operate between
OL,21,FWadhurst and Hastings.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
